    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2447/71 - 2025 \u0d85\u0dc1 \u0ddd\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dc3 02 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc1\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dc3\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.08.02\n\nNo. 2447/71 - SATURDAY, AUGUST 02, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nLand Ministry Ref. No. : 4-3/5/2012/HW/321.\n\nMy Ref. No.: DS/MG/LND/02/1/10.\n\nAcquisition of Land for the improvement of Badulla - Karametiya Andaulpotha road (23 km + 460 - 23 km + 480)\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act amended by the Land Acquisition Act (amendment) No. 28 of 1964 the land/servitude described below is required by the government and government intends to acquire the said land for public purpose.\n\nDescription of the land/servitude to be acquired : The lots of lands mentioned in the following schedule with the extent of 0.0039 hectare from the land Pihillegedarawatte in the supplementary 12, sheet 12 of F.V.P. 613 dated 29.10.2020 of Surveyor General in the Village of Meegahakiula of No. 22 Meegahakivula Grama Niladhari Division in Meegahakiula Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Badulla District in the Province of Uva.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\n1A - G 045030 - 34 (08/2025)\n\nSchedule 01. Lot No. 364 Name of the Land: Pihillegedarawatte; Current land use : Open bare land; Claimant: State; Reference to old Lots: F.V.P. 613 lots (blocks) No. 321; Extent: 0.0003 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 365 Name of the Land: Pihillegedarawatte; Current land use : Open bare land; Claimant: Welakonawatte Walawwe Senanayake Senavirathne Herath Mudiyanselage Chandrawathi Kumarihami of Pihillegedarawatte, Meegahakivula; Reference to old Lots: F.V.P. 613 lots (blocks) No. 325; Extent: 0.0034 Hectare."
