    "chunk_text": "1AIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.08.05PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.08.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dbaThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2448/15 \u2013 2025 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u02a4\u0dc3\u0dca\u01b1 \u0db8\u0dc3 05 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u025e\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.08.05No. 2448/15 \u2013 TUESDAY, AUGUST 05, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDSPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the lands described below are required for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nThe allotments of land described as following names and extents, depicted in the Advanced Tracing No. NU/AMB/2022/418 dated 24.02.2023, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village of Polpitiya in the Minor Division of Ambagamuwa Korale in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Ambagamuwa Korale in the District of Nuwara Eliya, Central Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Broadlandwatta \u2013 Extent: 0.0414 Hectare North: Broadlandwatta claimed by the State and Road; East: Broadlandwatta claimed by the State, Road and Broadlandwatta of which the claimant cannot be found; South: Broadlandwatta of which the claimant cannot be found; West: Lot B and Broadlandwatta claimed by the State.\n\n02. Lot \u2018B\u2019 \u2013 Broadlandwatta \u2013 Extent: 0.0282 Hectare North: Broadlandwatta claimed by the State; East: Broadlandwatta claimed by the State, Lot A and\n\nBroadlandwatta of which the claimant cannot be found; South: Broadlandwatta of which the claimant cannot be found and Lot C; West: Lot Cand Broadlandwatta claimed by the State."
