    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2448$19 - 2025 wf.daia;= ui 05 jeks w`.yrejdod - 2025'08'05No. 2448/19 - TUESDAY, AUGUST 05, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nLocal Government Notifications\n\n1A - PG 7219 - 05 (08/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nLOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nBY virtue of the Powers vested in me under the Section (I) of 66 (C) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and the provision of section 66 (G) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance, I do hereby informed that the name mentioned below was elected and declared by me as Vice Chairman of Lahugala Pradeshiya Sabha in Ampara District with the Co-Chaired of Hon. Chairman of Pradeshiya Sabha, Lahugala in the meeting held on the day of 01.08.2025 at 10.30 am at the Lahugala Pradeshiya Sabha Hall.\n\nA. L. M. Azmi, Commissioner of Local Government, Eastern Province. Office of the Department of Local Government,Eastern Province,Kanniya Road, Varothaya Nagar, Trincomalee,On this 04th day of August, 2025.\n\nSchedule\n\nDistrictName of the Local AuthorityName of the Vice Chairman\n\nAmparaLahugala Pradeshiya SabhaRavindra Kumara Gunawardhana\n\nEOG 08 - 0080\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
