    "chunk_text": "No. 37 of 1968 hereby appoint Mr. C. A. H. M. Wijerathna, Attorney-at-law, 31/1, HPT Main Road, Liyanagemulla, Seeduwa to be the arbitrator and refer the aforesaid dispute to him for settlement by arbitration.\n\nDr. ANIL JAYANTHA FERNANDO, Minister of Labour.\n\nColombo,31st July, 2025.\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/02/2023/234.\n\nThe Ceylon Mercantile, Industrial & General Workers\u2019 Union (CMU), No. 03, Bala Tampoe Lane, Colombo 3.\n\nand\n\nShore to Shore Private Limited, Ring Road 01, Export Processing Zone (EPZ), Katunayaka.\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is \u2013\n\nWhether Mr. S. G. Samantha Helakumara employed in Shore to Shore Private Limited has been caused injustice by the deprival of the payment of additional allowance of Rs. 5000/- from February 2022 and if so, to what relief he is entitled.\n\nH. M. D. N. K. WATALIYADDA, Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the Of\ufb01ce of the Commissioner General of Labour,Colombo, on this 16th day of July, 2025.\n\nEOG 08 \u2013 0056\n\n\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/02/2023/130.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON(1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nOrder under Section 4(1)\n\nWHEREAS an industrial dispute in respect of the matter speci\ufb01ed in the statement of the Commissioner General of Labour which accompanies this order exists between,\n\nMr. T. A. Roshan Ashroff, 21/6, Badulla Road, Haliela.\n\nand\n\nSri Lanka Bureau of Foreign Employment, 234, Denzil Kobbekaduwa Mawatha, Koswatta, Battaramulla.\n\n3AI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u