    "chunk_text": "Sri Lanka Bureau of Foreign Employment, 234, Denzil Kobbekaduwa Mawatha, Koswatta, Battaramulla.\n\n3AI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.08.05PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.08.2025\n\nDr. ANIL JAYANTHA FERNANDO, Minister of Labour.\n\nColombo,31st July, 2025.\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/02/2023/130.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON1956 REVISED EDITION\n\nMr. T. A. Roshan Ashroff, 21/6, Badulla Road, Haliela.\n\nand\n\nSri Lanka Bureau of Foreign Employment, 234, Denzil Kobbekaduwa Mawatha, Koswatta, Battaramulla.\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is \u2013\n\nWhether Mr. T. A. Roshan Ashroff, who worked at the Sri Lanka Bureau of Foreign Employment in the post of General Assistant (Grade S-IV) and was interdicted from 10.01.2019 had been caused injustice by the disciplinary punishments given in accordance with the formal disciplinary inquiry conducted against him by the SLBFE and if so, to what relief he is entitled.\n\nH. M. D. N. K. WATALIYADDA, Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the Of\ufb01ce of the Commissioner General of Labour,Colombo, on this 16th day of July, 2025.\n\nEOG 08 \u2013 0057\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
