    "chunk_size_bytes": 1990,
    "chunk_text": "WHEREAS an industrial dispute in respect of the matter specified in the statement of the Commissioner General of Labour which accompanies this order exists between,\n\nMr. G.Y. Gnanapala, 481/27, Salmal Uyana, Udumulla, Mulleriyawa.\n\nand\n\nUniversity of Colombo, P.O. Box. 1490, Kumarathunga Munidasa Mawatha, Colombo 03.\n\nDr. ANIL JAYANTHA FERNANDO, Minister of Labour.\n\nColombo,31st July, 2025.\n\n2AI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0da7\u0dc3 \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0da7\u0dc3: (I): (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.08.05\u2013 2025.08.05\n\nP\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d I: S\u0d7e\u0d7c. (I)P\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d I: S\u0d7e\u0d7c. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.08.2025 \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.08.2025\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/02/2023/258.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON1956 REVISED EDITION\n\nMr. G.Y. Gnanapala, 481/27, Salmal Uyana, Udumulla, Mulleriyawa.\n\nand\n\nUniversity of Colombo, P.O. Box. 1490, Kumarathunga Munidasa Mawatha, Colombo 03.\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is \u2013\n\nWhether Mr. G.Y. Gnanapala who was an employee of the Institute of Indigenous Medicine had been caused injustice by being promoted to Driver (Special Grade) from 03.06.2013, eventhough he had filled the requirements for the promotion as at 01.01.2008 and if so, to what relief he is entitled.\n\nH. M. D. N. K. WATALIYADDA, Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the Office of the Commissioner General of Labour,Colombo, on this 16th day of July, 2025.\n\nEOG 08- 0060\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/04/2022/124.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON(1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nRevocation of Order under Section 4(1)"
