    "chunk_text": "2. The camping area for abode of pilgrims shall be the land demarcated from the 37th Mile Post of Mahiyanganaya -Bibila Main Road up to the 2/39 culvert in front of Mahiyanganaya National School, the front area of Villu Wewa Road and the area of land bounded by the lanes called \u201cGangawata Veediya\u201d \u201cAngmedilla Veediya\u201d and \u201cDevala Veediya\u201d which approaches the clock tower from the front of Mahiyanganaya Hospital.\n\n3. It is hereby prohibited cooking meals or do selling in or around the courtyards of \u201cSthupa Maluwa\u201d, \u201cBo Maluwa\u201d and \u201cDevala Premises\u201d.\n\n1A \u2013 G 045094 \u2013 14 (08/2025)\n\nI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.08.12\n\nPART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u201312.08.2025 2A\n\n4. On a permit issued by Divisional Secretary/the o\ufb03 cer-in-charge of the camp area, selling of \ufb02 owers, joss sticks, candles, camphor, pooja items and idols for ritual purposes is allowed in the strip of land of \u201cMeda Veediya\u201d which is facing the \u201cStupa\u201d and in the strip of land situated to the left of the \u201cMakara Thorana\u201d.\n\n5. Selling of items speci\ufb01 ed in above is allowed also in the land ahead of the area facing the \u201cStupa\u201d except in the 60 permanent stalls constructed by the Rajamaha Vihara and Saman Devalaya.\n\n6. Within the camp area speci\ufb01 ed in above Section 2, selling and distribution of all food to pilgrims and selling of other commodities are allowed in already existing 60 permanent buildings and in the temporary stalls constructed on a permit issued by Divisional Secretary/the O\ufb03 cer-in-charge of the camp area.\n\n7. The area ahead of 10ft. from the water drain of both sides of Dutugemunu Street, Meda Mawatha, Ammedilla Road, Badulla-Mahiyanganaya Main Road, Bodimaluwa Mawatha and the road in front of the \u201cSangawasa (Bikku abode), that is noticed as the route of perahera by the \u201cBasnayaka Nilame\u201d and Ven. Chief Incumbent, is reserved for business purposes."
