    "chunk_text": "1). It is hereby notified that this order is issued granting permission to extend the time period to North Central Provincial Pradeshiya Sabhas to act as the section No.24 of the Pradeshiya Sabha Act and ordering to publish required procedures depicting the list of road and lanes and to establish the provisions to implement the matters regarding them and all other consequential matters as appropriately, whereas the roads and lanes that are considered as belonging to pradeshiya Sabha as per the section 23 of aforesaid Act, whereas the Maps of the roads and lanes should be prepared, boundary stones should be established and the boundaries should be marked under section No. 24 of the said Act within three years with effect from the date of enactment of the Pradeshiya Sabha Act No. 15 of 1987, namely, prior to 11th of May 1990, whereas required orders have not been established up to now though it is ordered that the notices should be published as the order have been made.\n\n2). This order may be cited as the order of preparation of Maps of roads and lanes maintained by Pradeshiya Sabhas of North Central Provincial Council.\n\n3). (1).Powers are conferred to North Central Provincial Pradeshiya Sabha to extend the of period of 12 months with effect from the enactment of this order to act under section No. 24 of aforesaid Pradeshiya Sabha Act by virtue of the powers vested by subsection (1) of section No. 24 of Pradeshiya Sabha Act No. 15 of 1987, hereinafter cited as \u2018Act\u2019 read with the section No. 2 of the section No. 12 of Provincial Council Act No. 12 of 1989 (consequential Provisions)\n\n3).(2). If it is required to extend the period, by submitting the special reasons for the requirement of extending of period for the completion of the tasks for any Pradeshiya Sabha of North Central province hereafter cited as \u2018Sabha\u2019 which fails to complete the tasks within twelve months granted as per the sub section (1)"
