    "chunk_text": "1AIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.08.14PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 14.08.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dbaThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2449/44 \u2013 2025 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u02a4\u0dc3\u0dca\u01b1 \u0db8\u0dc3 14 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u022f\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u01af\u01e6\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.08.14No. 2449/44 \u2013 THURSDAY, AUGUST 14, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDSPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 33\n\nReference No.: Ath1/A/19.\n\nI, Sandaruwan Anuruddha, Divisional Secretary of the Colombo District, do hereby inform that, for the land to be acquired as described in the following Schedule under Section 33 of the Land Acquisition Act, with regard that the compensation amount of Rupees Four Hundred and Seventy Thousand Eight Hundred and Sixty Six and Twenty Eight cents (Rs. 470,866.28) has been credited under the Case No. DLA/25/24 of the District Court of Colombo enabling receive the payment to the Owners.\n\nSandaruwan Anuruddha, Divisional Secretary, Colombo.\n\nAt the Divisional Secretariat of Colombo,On this 11th day of August, 2025.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nName of the land : Assmt. Nos. 276/5, 276/6A, 276/6B, 276/7, 276/8 and 276/15 and part of the 276/6C of Sri Sangharaja MawathaPlan No. : P.P.C. 6549Lot No. : 01Extent : 0.1059 HectareLocation : Situated in the Village of Maligawatta West in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Colombo in Colombo District.Money Deposited : Rupees Four Hundred and Seventy Thousand Eight Hundred and Sixty Six and Twenty Eight cents only(Rs. 470,866.28)Bank and Branch : National Savings Bank, Pettah Branch\n\nEOG 08 \u2013 0152\n\n1A \u2013 G 045128 \u2013 19 (08/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
