    "chunk_text": "PART III - LANDS\n\nTitle Registration\n\nREGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998\n\nDeclaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby declare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land Nos. 2 : 2, 2 : 3, 2 : 4, 2 : 6, 2 : 7, 2 : 10, 2 : 12, 2 : 14, 2 : 15, 2 : 16, 2 : 17, 2 : 18, 2 : 19, 2 : 21, 2 : 23, 3 : 1, 3 : 2, 3 : 3, 3 : 4, 3 : 5, 3 : 7 and 3 : 8 of Block 2, contained in the Cadastral Map No. 110623, situated in the Village of Palayakulama within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 538-Palayakulama in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Nachchaduwa, in the District of Anuradhapura, in the Province of North Central, referred to in Notice No. 11/0477 calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 2367/48 of 20th January, 2024 in terms of Section 12 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. P. C. D. Sigera, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla, 23rd July, 2025.\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2449/48 - 2025 \u0d85\u0dc1 \u0ddd\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dc3 15 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.08.15\n\nNo. 2449/48 \u2013 FRIDAY, AUGUST 15, 202