    "chunk_text": "21. Lot \u2018BD\u2019 \u2013 Galabendihena \u2013 Extent: 0.0045 Hectare North: Lot BC; East: Lots BM and BG; South: Lot BE; West: Public Market.\n\n22. Lot \u2018BG\u2019 \u2013 Galabendihena \u2013 Extent: 0.0022 Hectare North: Lot BM; East: Lot BH; South: Road (Road Development Authority); West: Lots BF, BE and BD.\n\n23. Lot \u2018BM\u2019 \u2013 Galabendihena \u2013 Extent: 0.0780 Hectare North: Lots AY, BP, BN, T and Fair Premises; East: Road; South: Road (Road Development Authority), Lots BK, BJ, BH and BG; West: Lots BK, BJ, BH, BG, BD,BC, BB, BA, AZ, AY, BP and BN .\n\nEOG 08 \u2013 0178\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nREVOCATION UNDER SECTION 39(1)\n\nTHE allotments of land speci\ufb01ed morefully in the Order No. 113 of 2020 dated 09.09.2020 made under the Proviso (a) to Section 38 of the Land Acquisition Act and published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2192/62 dated 11.09.2020 was vested in the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka. The possession of the land depicted below has not yet been taken for and on behalf of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka. Therefore, I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation, by virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 39(1) of the Land Acquisition Act, do hereby revoke the Order in respect of the land speci\ufb01ed in the Schedule of the Order No. 113 of 2020 dated 09.09.2020 published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2192/62 dated 11.09.2020.\n\nK. D. LAL KANTHA, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation.\n\nMy No.: 4-3/16/2018/UDA/305. Divisional Secretary\u2019s No.: DSWA/LND/4/ACQUI/F1/44B.Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Land Secretariat,1200/6, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla,24th July, 2025.SCHEDULE"
